From the sound of it, I'd guess you found one of Nethack's special
levels, either the Castle or Vlad's Tower.  Since you said you were in
hell, I'm going to assume you meant the latter.

     -------------------	If there was a feature in the 
     |                 |	center of the level like this,
     |   --- --- ---   |	then you have found Vlad's Tower.
     | 	 | | | | | |   |	
     | --+ +-+ +-+ +-- |	If there's a door right there where
     | |             | |	that star is, well that's where you 
     | --+         +-- --	should enter.
     |   |     --> * 
     | --+         +-- --	If not, go down two levels and work
     | |             | |	your way back up until you find that
     | --+ +-+ +-+ +-- |	door.  The Tower has three levels to
     |   | | | | | |   |	it, you see, and it can only be entered 
     |   --- --- ---   |	at the bottom.
     |                 |
     -------------------

Once you have found that door, you can enter the Tower and climb to
the top.  There you will come face to face with Vlad the Impaler.  If
you are at all worried about vampires, maybe you should just let him
be.  If you do take him on, you will discover that one of his minions
is guarding an amulet of life saving.  It's not necessary to fight him
to win, but it does sort of add an extra challenge.

Have fun!

